    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-10-28T00:41:45Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A small tray by the front door gives keys and loose change a reliable home; choose one you already own, such as a saucer or shallow bowl.</div>
    </content>
