    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-10-28T00:41:45Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Give a wooden spoon a quick check for rough splinters; smooth a tiny snag gently with the edge of a sturdy cardboard scrap, then wipe it clean.</div>
